Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:23.600
The movie is set in an imaginary matriarchal&nbsp;
totalitarian country called the Bubunia. In&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:29.280
Bubunia, the roles of men and women are reversed,&nbsp;
up to the point where the male population is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:35.680
deprived of any civil rights, including work,&nbsp;
education, military service, freedom of marriage,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:42.080
etc. Men wear headscarves and long veils to cover&nbsp;
every part of their body and dress modestly.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:47.680
While women are allowed to wear pants and shirts.&nbsp;
The country has been led by the family of ruthless&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:54.240
female Generaless for decades. Moreover, the&nbsp;
significant positions in politics, business,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:59.600
and the military are all held by women while&nbsp;
men are expected to do all the domestic work and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:05.120
look pretty for women’s pleasure. In the opening&nbsp;
scene, we are introduced to a handsome young man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:10.640
named Jacky who is whipped for Generaless's&nbsp;
daughter and the future leader of the state,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:16.160
the Coloness. The television shows a live&nbsp;
ceremony from the Grand Mushery Palace.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:21.440
The event is held by the Generaless to announce&nbsp;
something important to the people and also to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:26.800
execute the male criminals of the month. 
Before the ceremony, two royal white horses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:31.440
are worshipped as per tradition. They&nbsp;
are considered sacred in the country.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:36.800
Then the honorable ministers of the nation,&nbsp;
who are all women, are introduced. At last,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:42.080
the Coloness and the Generaless appear in front&nbsp;
of the cheering crowd. The Coloness is the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:48.480
eligible bachelor of the town and is liked by all&nbsp;
while her mother and the ruler Generaless is very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:54.160
strict and is feared by everyone. Jacky does&nbsp;
household work while watching the show on TV.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:59.600
Just then, his mother returns from work&nbsp;
exhausted. Jacky tends to her needs and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:04.720
the two watch the show while chatting. His mother&nbsp;
claims that four girls from the town asked for her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:10.480
permission to marry him at her work. It is clear&nbsp;
that Jacky is popular among the girls of the town&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:15.520
because of his beauty. They hit on the guy&nbsp;
every day, to the point, he feels violated.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:21.040
Although he can get any girl he likes, Jacky only&nbsp;
has the Coloness in his heart and wishes to marry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:27.520
her someday. In the show, the criminals are hanged&nbsp;
in front of a cheering crowd. In Bubunia, the only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:33.200
source of nutrition is a white sticky substance&nbsp;
that is delivered from waterpipe-like sinks called&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:39.200
Paste. The Generaless then gives a speech stating&nbsp;
the importance of the “paste”. She also declares&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:44.160
that she wants to resign from her post and hand&nbsp;
the responsibility over to the Coloness. 
&nbsp;

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:49.200
But as per tradition, the Coloness needs to&nbsp;
be married before taking over the throne.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:53.360
She announces that all the men from the country&nbsp;
should compete against each other for a chance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:59.440
to marry the Coloness and become the “Big Dummy”.&nbsp;
She ends the speech by inviting every man to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:05.360
Grand Bubunnery ball for the competition. Jacky&nbsp;
is overly delighted by the announcement. He runs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:10.320
outside in happiness jumping and dancing like&nbsp;
every other man in the country. One the way,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:16.080
he sees a group of men praying to a random horse&nbsp;
to make them the big dummy. He joins them and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:21.920
prays as well. One of the men is Jacky’s cousin&nbsp;
Vergio who claims that the horse talked to him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:28.400
and said he will be the big dummy. Jacky calls&nbsp;
him out stating that lying is a big blasphemy. As&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:34.320
they talk, some teenage girls nearby call Jacky&nbsp;
hot and argue about who is going to marry him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:40.400
Following that, Jacky, Vergio, and his brother&nbsp;
go to a clothing shop to buy veils for the Grand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:46.240
Bubunnery ball. Vergio’s parents are rich in&nbsp;
contrast to Jacky’s mother. They make fun of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:51.520
him for not being able to afford a nice vail.&nbsp;
The salesgirl hits on Jacky saying that he is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:55.760
the most handsome of them all and that she&nbsp;
imagines him on her bed every night. 
&nbsp;

00:03:56.320 --> 00:04:02.000
Jacky, who feels uncomfortable, starts talking to&nbsp;
the shop’s owner but she too asks him to marry her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:07.520
daughter. Back at home, Jacky writes poetry, which&nbsp;
is uncommon for his gender, while his brother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:13.280
Julin makes love to a woman in the other room.&nbsp;
Julin is a prostitute whose ambition is to leave&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:18.160
the country one day. He has been told that the&nbsp;
people from other countries are allowed to dance,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:24.080
sing, and eat varieties of food, in contrast to&nbsp;
their sticky paste. Moreover, he believes that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:28.960
Jacky’s father had a treasure hidden somewhere&nbsp;
which he will soon find. He asks his brother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:33.760
to help him with the mission but Jacky claims&nbsp;
he has enough reasons to stay in the country.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:38.480
The following day, Jacky and his mother go&nbsp;
to buy tickets for the Grand Bubunnery ball&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:42.640
but come across protesters outside the&nbsp;
ticket counter. It turns out that the men&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:47.360
wishing to become the big dummy should pay&nbsp;
forty thousand Bubes which most men cannot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:52.160
afford because they live in poverty. 
Jacky’s uncle and his family come out after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:56.880
buying the bright red ticket to the ball. They&nbsp;
make fun of his mother for being poor and boast&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.880 --> 00:05:02.960
about how Vergio is going to marry the Coloness.&nbsp;
Jacky returns home and cries himself to bed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:08.000
Later, he brings the police to his own house,&nbsp;
accusing his brother Julin of not returning his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:12.880
money. He believes that their father had left them&nbsp;
a treasure that Julin has been hiding from them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:16.880
As the police search through their house,&nbsp;
they find no treasure but get their hands&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:21.200
on a foreign magazine that is forbidden&nbsp;
in the country. To Jacky’s surprise,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:26.560
Julin is arrested for possession. He apologizes&nbsp;
to his mother saying that it was not his intention&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:32.080
but it is too late now. However, his guilt turns&nbsp;
into happiness when the Sheriffess, gives him a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:38.000
free ticket to the ball in turn of him reporting&nbsp;
Julin. The very next day, he happily goes to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:43.360
clothing store again to get himself clothes for&nbsp;
the ball. When returning, he sees an ambulance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:48.640
bringing his mother to the hospital. Jacky quickly&nbsp;
rushes to his mother’s side only to find out that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:54.720
