the last goodbye to her son and passes away.
&nbsp;

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:59.600
After the incident, Jacky starts to live with his&nbsp;
uncle’s family who hates him and treats him like a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:05.600
