and spit it out saying it isn’t mashed enough. One&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:10.480
day, he hears them talk about Julin escaping from&nbsp;
the prison and assume he died when his house was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:17.360
