he has no one by his side now. He is at the shop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:22.240
complaining to a salesgirl about his problems.&nbsp;
The girl, who is also attracted to Jacky,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:27.520
offers him a ride to the grand ball in turn for&nbsp;
sexual favors. However, while they are at it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:33.120
they are caught by Jacky’s uncle. Upon inspection,&nbsp;
they find Jacky’s ticket to the ball and decide to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:38.880
give it to Vergio’s younger brother. Jacky cries&nbsp;
in vain seeing his only opportunity to a good life&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:44.640
getting away. Then, Vergio and his brother get&nbsp;
ready in beautiful vails to finally go to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:50.400
ball. Jacky reluctantly helps them get ready. 
One day before the ball, all the contestants in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:56.960
beautiful while vail arrive at the palace. The&nbsp;
event is televised nationwide. Jacky is at home&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.960 --> 00:07:02.240
crying when he hears someone telling him to run&nbsp;
away. He believes that it is the sacred horse&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:07.120
speaking and manages to run away from his aunt’s&nbsp;
home. After running in the rain for a while,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:12.720
three women stop him and ask him why he is out.&nbsp;
Taking advantage of the poor guy’s situation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:17.440
they assault him sexually. Just then, Julin&nbsp;
appears out of nowhere and kills the women&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:22.720
to save his brother. He claims that he provided&nbsp;
sexual favors to the guards and freed himself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:27.120
from the prison. He has been living in&nbsp;
the forest and growing plants ever since.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:32.320
Julin then shows Jacky a turnip farm, proving&nbsp;
that the paste isn’t the only thing humans can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:37.440
eat and that the generaless has been lying&nbsp;
to everyone. Julin’s plan is to sell the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:43.120
turnips and get enough money to buy passports and&nbsp;
leave the country. He includes Jacky in his plan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:47.840
and the two change into “women’s clothes''&nbsp;
and wear wigs to disguise themselves. 
&nbsp;

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:53.280
Julin also reveals that their father was a rebel&nbsp;
who wanted equal rights for men. They founded a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:59.600
secret movement for men's rights called Meninism.&nbsp;
But he was hanged for his efforts. The two then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:04.880
get on a horse and make their way to the palace&nbsp;
to sell the turnips. They meet a higher officer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:11.120
who happens to know Julin’s secret and asks for a&nbsp;
sexual favor. Jacky is sent outside so he wanders&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:16.960
around the palace and eventually ends up at the&nbsp;
ball. Several men in the same vail are impatiently&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:22.240
waiting for the Coloness’s arrival. Some minutes&nbsp;
later, the Coloness and the generaless arrive at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:27.520
the ball. Jacky is self speechless by the&nbsp;
Coloness’s beauty. As she scans through the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:33.440
crowd of men, her eyes land on Jacky, who is still&nbsp;
dressed like a woman. They make eye contact but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:39.440
Jacky looks away flustered. Then, the men surround&nbsp;
the Coloness trying to prove they are submissive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.440 --> 00:08:44.960
and hence, eligible to be the big dummy.
Meanwhile, Jacky is approached by his uncle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:50.480
and his younger son. They mistake him for a girl&nbsp;
