00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:34.320
are disturbed by the generaless who wants the&nbsp;
Coloness to come back to the ball. Now, the big&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:40.080
dummy is about to be announced when Jacky’s uncle&nbsp;
recognizes him in the crowd and attacks him. 
&nbsp;

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:46.640
Jacky’s wig is taken off and he announces his love&nbsp;
to the Coloness as a man. But the generaless sends&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:51.840
her guards behind him. A chase ensues in the&nbsp;
palace; Jacky eventually ends up in a secret&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:57.280
room with several pipes. Upon investigation, he&nbsp;
