00:09:57.280 --> 00:10:02.880
is recycled human feces mixed with vitamins.&nbsp;
The generaless has been giving speeches about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:08.240
the paste being a gift to the nation, but in&nbsp;
reality, she is feeding the poor their own feces,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:12.320
so they won’t eat away all the food&nbsp;
and vegetables. After knowing this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:17.120
Jacky presses a button in the control panel that&nbsp;
causes the feces to go to the water pipes without&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:22.320
being filtered. The whole country is now supplied&nbsp;
with disgusting feces mixed with water. 
&nbsp;

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:28.320
Coloness is on her bed when she hears noises from&nbsp;
under it. She finds Jacky inside and asks him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:34.000
his true motive. He confesses his love to her and&nbsp;
