Because he revealed the truth about the paste,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:44.720
the entire country believes Jacky to be a hero.&nbsp;
However, the generaless doesn’t share the view,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:49.680
so when he and the Coloness are in bed, the&nbsp;
