he has seen too much. But before she can harm him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:11.920
the Coloness strangles her to death. Following&nbsp;
that, the new lovers reunite and kiss.
&nbsp;

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:16.080
Together, the two open the borders&nbsp;
of Bubunia and establish democracy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:21.440
in the country. Jacky opens schools for boys&nbsp;
