00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:26.560
emancipation and restore the country's agriculture&nbsp;
where people are provided with green foods,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:31.920
not feces. In the last scene, when Coloness&nbsp;
and Jacky are about to officially marry, they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:37.440
announce that Bubunia wants "no more secrets from&nbsp;
