00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:49.200
It turns out that Generaless had no daughters&nbsp;
despite years of trying, so she wanted her last&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:54.320
child to become the state leader despite being&nbsp;
